{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a relaxing building game. Enjoy the joy of creating something with no management, no battles and no wrong answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax to chill vibes</strong> and escape to a world that feels alive. Create a warm, inviting atmosphere with plants and animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919450/extras/dcd1f33fb0f2171ad05ca012fcffa1a8.poster.avif?t=1760708081\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919450/extras/dcd1f33fb0f2171ad05ca012fcffa1a8.webm?t=1760708081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919450/extras/dcd1f33fb0f2171ad05ca012fcffa1a8.mp4?t=1760708081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your creativity</strong> to place objects and voxels to customise the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919450/extras/d9bf61216c8e588727ecac743f3828f8.poster.avif?t=1760708081\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919450/extras/d9bf61216c8e588727ecac743f3828f8.webm?t=1760708081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919450/extras/d9bf61216c8e588727ecac743f3828f8.mp4?t=1760708081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Builder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2919450/a2015282129ae7